  "reason": "The strongest evidence so far is config_017, where multiprofile scgpt + ViT-L with avgpool and concat reaches 0.518 accuracy and 0.484 F1, far above single-profile multimodal baselines. However, only one multiprofile aggregation strategy has been tested, so it is unclear whether avgpool is sufficient or whether transformer aggregation can further improve profile integration. config_020 changes only aggregation from avgpool to transformer while keeping the same model setting, profile setting, RNA encoder, image encoder, and concat fusion. This isolates the effect of aggregation, exploits the currently best direction, and is a high-value next experiment under a limited budget."
